    "https://www.eur.nl/en/working-at-eur/vacancies/aicloud-application-specialist": {
      "title": "AI&Cloud Application Specialist",
      "description": "AI&Cloud Application Specialist | Working at | Erasmus University Rotterdam Skip to main content Skip to search Skip to subnavigation Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Close Open search Close Open menu Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Switch language to EN English current language NL Nederlands Search Close Search Search Primary Why work at EUR Open submenu Why work at EUR Campus Diversity Societal involvement Sustainability Working conditions Working areas Open submenu Working areas Academic staff Working in Finance Working in IT Working at Legal Affairs Working at Real Estate & Facilities PhD LDE traineeship International staff Practical information Open submenu Practical information Candidate portal Vacancies AI&Cloud Application Specialist Listen This vacancy is only available in Dutch. Use the button below to view it in Dutch. View vacancy in Dutch Open navigation for AI&Cloud Application Specialist Close Compare 0 study programme Close Compare 0 study programme Compare study programmes Breadcrumb Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Vacancies AI&Cloud Application Specialist Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Directly to Information Directly to Why work at EUR Working areas International staff Practical information Vacancies Information ANBI Cookies Disclaimer Privacy statement Accessibility Our channels Facebook Instagram X (formerly twitter) Linkedin Youtube Making Minds Matter Watch the video Close"
